    ["Produced from a mine in Coniston, Midseashire, Loen Kingdom. Although the entire city was severely devastated by the war, it possesses a large amount of materials containing spirituality. Because of the strange rumors often surrounding the mine, workers only dare to dig for the flint on the outermost layer."] = "Produced from a mine in Coniston, Midseashire, Loen Kingdom. Although the entire city was severely devastated by the war, it possesses a large amount of materials containing Духовность. Because of the strange rumors often surrounding the mine, workers only dare to dig for the flint on the outermost layer.",
    ["It's my family's house with hundreds of years of history. That place is too dilapidated, I plan to sell it for some money to subsidize the family."] = "Это дом моей семьи с сотнями лет истории. Это место слишком ветхое, я планирую продать его за какие-то деньги, чтобы прокормить семью.",
    ["Legendary Spirit Line: Tingen"] = "Легендарная линия духов: Тинген",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Uninvited Tune】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Urban Anecdotes</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </>Music that isn't very melodious always drifts from the lake... Go listen to who is playing?\n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>66</>, head to {Location:[Hornacis Sea of Flowers(452,600)]|35310;50501;15247;2;5202005;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Нежелательный звук】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Тип задания: </><Assistant_Property2>Анекдоты тех времен</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Описание задания: </> Из озера всегда доносятся мелодичные звуки музыки... Идите и послушайте, кто играет? \n<Assistant_Title2>Как получить: </>После того, как игровой уровень достигнет <Assistant_Red>66</>, перейдите в {Местоположение:[Хонакис Цветочное море (452,600)]|3 5310;50501;15247;2;5202005;0} можно запускать задания \n<Assistant_Title2>task Награды</>: познавательный опыт, счета-фактуры, медали приключений, прогресс в секретных сокровищах мира приключений.",
